# Sysmon Process and Network Tracker

This PowerShell script monitors a specific executable and its child processes for network activity and DNS queries using Sysmon logs. It provides real-time visibility into process creation, network connections, and DNS resolution attempts, and exports final reports to CSV.

## 🚀 Features

- Tracks process creation (Sysmon Event ID 1)
- Monitors network connections (Sysmon Event ID 3)
- Captures DNS queries (Sysmon Event ID 22)
- Detects failed connections based on DNS queries without matching network events
- Displays live updates in the console
- Exports final logs to CSV files

